# Portal permissions

- Default remains **IsAuthenticated** via `ApiAuthMixin`.
- Use `users.permissions.IsAdmin` / `IsCustomer` only when the view is portal-scoped.
- Prefer explicit flags on `BaseUser` (e.g. `is_admin`) over inventing parallel auth stacks.
- Do not treat staff flags as a substitute for object-level checks.

